# EXOS: show vlan (a starting point - check it against your release's output)
Value NAME (\S+)
Value VID (\d+)
Value ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value MASK (\d+)
Value FLAGS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value ACTIVE_PORTS (\d+)
Value TOTAL_PORTS (\d+)
Value VR (\S+)

Start
  ^${NAME}\s+${VID}\s+(?:${ADDRESS}\s*/${MASK}\s+)?${FLAGS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${ACTIVE_PORTS}\s*/\s*${TOTAL_PORTS}\s+${VR} -> Record
